        Tooltip:
          String: "Recolor replaces colors in the base texture. \\nThis is useful for adding variety to assets, ex: recolor a red shirt with a green logo to a blue shirt with a black logo, or any other color combination. \\nWhere the base texture is red, you will get whatever color you set in Recolor Red, and same thing for the green and blue channels of the base texture. \\nThis also works in combination if the base color is not a pure red, green or blue color."
        UniqueID:
          String: Recolor
      PositionX: 1185
